('weneedblack-cheongdam', 'WENEEDBLACK The Cheongdam', '위닛블랙 더청담점', 'salon'::place_category, 'place'::place_entry_type, 'Cheongdam', '서울 강남구 압구정로80길 34, 원일빌딩 3층 (청담동)', 'Premium hair salon', 'A newly opened Cheongdam hair salon under the WENEEDBLACK brand (operator LIVEX), with modern, trend-led cut and colour work.', 'It''s the Cheongdam branch of a brand with a growing following, opened in 2026 right in Seoul''s most exclusive salon district.', 'trend-led cut and colour in a premium Cheongdam salon', 'WENEEDBLACK''s Cheongdam branch sits on the third floor at 34 Apgujeong-ro 80-gil in Cheongdam-dong, run by the LIVEX group that also operates the premium WENEED flagship line. It opened in 2026 with modern, trend-focused hair work.

