('signicho-nail-hongdae', 'Signicho Nail Hongdae', '시그니초네일 홍대점', 'nail_lash'::place_category, 'place'::place_entry_type, 'Hongdae', '서울 마포구 어울마당로 54, 대호빌딩 2층 (서교동)', 'Nail art studio', 'A busy, budget-friendly nail-art studio on Hongdae''s main walking street, with a heavy portfolio and a big following.', 'It''s exactly the rising Hongdae nail studio travellers ask about — a large active Instagram following, fixed budget-friendly pricing from around 29,000 won, and a central location on the walking street.', 'affordable, photo-ready nail art right on the Hongdae walking street', 'Signicho Nail is a nail-art studio on the second floor at 54 Eoulmadang-ro in Seogyo-dong, on Hongdae''s main walking street. It runs a heavy nail-art portfolio, keeps fixed budget-friendly pricing (gel from around 29,000 won, monthly art from 39,000), and hours of 10:00–21:00, open year-round.

