('sketch-on-nails', 'The Sketch Nails', '스캐치드 온 네일', 'nail_lash'::place_category, 'place'::place_entry_type, 'Hongdae', '서울 마포구 와우산로29나길 7, 지층 2호 (서교동)', 'Nail art studio', 'A small Hongdae nail studio known for photogenic anime/character (오타쿠) nail art, minutes from Hongik University station.', 'Its anime-and-character nail art is genuinely distinctive and internationally photogenic — a standout for visitors who want something beyond standard gel work.', 'highly photogenic character and anime-themed nail art near Hongdae station', 'The Sketch Nails is a one-person nail studio on the lower level at 7 Wausan-ro 29na-gil in Seogyo-dong, a few minutes from Hongik University station exit 7. It specialises in photogenic anime and character (오타쿠) nail art, with fixed monthly-art pricing around 39,000 won.

