('gonggan-nail-hongdae', 'Gonggan Nail (Hongdae Branch 2)', '공간네일 홍대2호점', 'nail_lash'::place_category, 'place'::place_entry_type, 'Hongdae', '서울 마포구 양화로 156, LG팰리스빌딩 605호 (동교동)', 'Nail art studio (chain branch)', 'The second Hongdae branch of the established Gonggan Nail chain, in the LG Palace building by Hongik University station.', 'It''s a branch of a well-run nail-art chain — gel, extensions and monthly art with dependable quality — a lower-risk option than an unknown independent.', 'reliable chain-quality gel and nail art near Hongdae station', 'Gonggan Nail''s second Hongdae branch is on the fifth floor (room 605) of the LG Palace building at 156 Yanghwa-ro in Donggyo-dong, by Hongik University station. It opened in 2026 as part of an established Seoul nail-art chain covering gel, extensions and monthly art, with hours of 10:00–21:00.

